Cell["2. Five-point MRK kinematics", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"6b011e15-9e40-4a68-9968-86709fecd1f0"],

Cell["\<\
We use the all-outgoing convention -p1,-p2 -> p3,p4,p5. The physical region \
has s12,s34,s45>0 and s23,s15<0. Ordinary MRK is p3+ >> p4+ >> p5+ and p3- << \
p4- << p5-, with transverse momenta of the same parametric size. Section 2 of \
NNLL exploration of the high-energy limit of QCD 2->3 scattering amplitudes \
writes s12=s/x^2, s34=s2/x, s45=s1/x, s23=t2 and s15=t1.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3bdf71da-7bca-4277-b0d3-5a3f20d53594"],

Cell["\<\
At leading MRK order, p3_perp=-z p4_perp and p5_perp=-(1-z)p4_perp, while \
|p4_perp|^2=s1 s2/s. Therefore p4_perp -> 0 at fixed momentum transfers is \
correlated: z and zbar diverge, p3_perp=-p5_perp at the limiting surface, and \
t1=t2 there.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"498c8cb1-545b-4c1e-86fa-fec43e4c1e5f"],

Cell["Exact local light-cone chart", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"1ba1aea6-0d31-4904-a4a8-84ae0fffaabd"],

Cell["\<\
Set p4_perp=delta^a k and the MRK gap x=delta^b, with 0<a<b. Choose p3+=P \
delta^(-b), p4+=K delta^a and p5-=M delta^(-b). On-shellness fixes p3-=T \
delta^b/P, p4-=R delta^a/K and p5+=(T+sigma C delta^a+R delta^(2a)) \
delta^b/M. Here T=|p3_perp|^2, R=|k|^2, and sigma C=2 Re(p3_perp \
conjugate(k)). Exact momentum conservation fixes the incoming components. The \
physical parameter domain used by HRF is P,M,K,R,T,C>0 and C^2<4 R T, with \
sigma=+1 and -1 checked separately.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"541c7190-beac-4c38-b100-9c56916ac1ca"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"hrf5MRKExactCentralSoftRules", "[", 
  RowBox[{"1", ",", "2", ",", "1"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"c938c2eb-9906-4392-9a6a-faf804e45172"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"s12", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"C", " ", "delta"}], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{"K", " ", "M"}], "delta"], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{"M", " ", "P"}], 
      SuperscriptBox["delta", "4"]], "+", 
     RowBox[{"2", " ", 
      SuperscriptBox["delta", "2"], " ", "R"}], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{"C", " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "4"], " ", "R"}], 
      RowBox[{"K", " ", "M"}]], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{"P", " ", "R"}], 
      RowBox[{"delta", " ", "K"}]], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "5"], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["R", "2"]}], 
      RowBox[{"K", " ", "M"}]], "+", 
     RowBox[{"2", " ", "T"}], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "3"], " ", "K", " ", "T"}], "P"], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{"C", " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "5"], " ", "T"}], 
      RowBox[{"M", " ", "P"}]], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "3"], " ", "R", " ", "T"}], 
      RowBox[{"K", " ", "M"}]], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "6"], " ", "R", " ", "T"}], 
      RowBox[{"M", " ", "P"}]], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "4"], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["T", "2"]}], 
      RowBox[{"M", " ", "P"}]]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"s23", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", "T"}], "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "3"], " ", "K", " ", "T"}], "P"], "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{"C", " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "5"], " ", "T"}], 
      RowBox[{"M", " ", "P"}]], "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "6"], " ", "R", " ", "T"}], 
      RowBox[{"M", " ", "P"}]], "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "4"], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["T", "2"]}], 
      RowBox[{"M", " ", "P"}]]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"s34", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "C"}], " ", "delta"}], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{"P", " ", "R"}], 
      RowBox[{"delta", " ", "K"}]], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "3"], " ", "K", " ", "T"}], "P"]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"s45", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"C", " ", "delta"}], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{"K", " ", "M"}], "delta"], "+", 
     RowBox[{"2", " ", 
      SuperscriptBox["delta", "2"], " ", "R"}], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{"C", " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "4"], " ", "R"}], 
      RowBox[{"K", " ", "M"}]], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "5"], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["R", "2"]}], 
      RowBox[{"K", " ", "M"}]], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "3"], " ", "R", " ", "T"}], 
      RowBox[{"K", " ", "M"}]]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"s15", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "C"}], " ", "delta"}], "-", 
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["delta", "2"], " ", "R"}], "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{"C", " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "4"], " ", "R"}], 
      RowBox[{"K", " ", "M"}]], "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "5"], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["R", "2"]}], 
      RowBox[{"K", " ", "M"}]], "-", "T", "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{"C", " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "5"], " ", "T"}], 
      RowBox[{"M", " ", "P"}]], "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "3"], " ", "R", " ", "T"}], 
      RowBox[{"K", " ", "M"}]], "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "6"], " ", "R", " ", "T"}], 
      RowBox[{"M", " ", "P"}]], "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["delta", "4"], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["T", "2"]}], 
      RowBox[{"M", " ", "P"}]]}]}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",ExpressionUUID->"15912686-f5ea-4840-ac1a-133ac9819571"],

Cell["\<\
The rapidity hierarchy is transparent in the light-cone components. Since \
delta tends to zero and 0<a<b, p3 is forward, p5 is backward and p4 remains \
at finite central rapidity:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"da9740d6-4c3f-4646-ba88-d287f202ec05"],

