c998ac1a55ce"],

Cell["8. Negative controls and interpretation", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"a9f01f4c-219b-4f70-8652-f1e1e124d134"],

Cell["\<\
All twelve one-loop pentagon labelings fail already at the recursive \
mixed-derivative pinch preselection for each of the three tested rates. \
Generic MRK gives no certified HR for any labeling of the two-loop seed: six \
labelings produce staged near-misses, but the lower-facet audit rejects them. \
The exact central-soft corrections change the occupied layers and turn one of \
the three staged presentations into a full facet precisely when p4 is \
attached to a four-valent seed vertex.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cfdbdef1-5ccb-4e76-b318-4d9dcb5b2b38"],

Cell["\<\
This establishes that the earlier blanket statement 'there is no HR in \
five-point MRK' is not correct once the central-soft composite limit is \
included. What is established here is narrower: one specific two-loop seed \
family and all its inequivalent external labelings. A topology scan of its \
vertex-split descendants is the natural next step.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"eb1f4ecd-ed1d-47b9-836d-c56030a68242"],

Cell["9. Reproduction", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"6fcdc391-8f14-486a-8fbb-66afb2d8d962"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"$HRF5MRKNotebookDirectory", "=", 
   RowBox[{"NotebookDirectory", "[", "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"$HRF5MRKSupportDirectory", "=", 
   RowBox[{"If", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"FileExistsQ", "[", 
      RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
        "$HRF5MRKNotebookDirectory", 
         ",", "\"\<HRF_FivePointMRKExploratory.wl\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}],
      ",", "$HRF5MRKNotebookDirectory", ",", 
     RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
       "$HRF5MRKNotebookDirectory", ",", "\"\<examples\>\"", 
        ",", "\"\<five_point_mrk_central_soft\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}],
   ";", 
  RowBox[{"$HRF5MRKRepoDirectory", "=", 
   RowBox[{"If", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"FileExistsQ", "[", 
      RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
        "$HRF5MRKNotebookDirectory", ",", "\"\<HiddenRegionFinder.wl\>\""}], 
        "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", "$HRF5MRKNotebookDirectory", ",", 
     RowBox[{"DirectoryName", "[", 
      RowBox[{"DirectoryName", "[", "$HRF5MRKSupportDirectory", "]"}], 
      "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"$HRF5MRKLibraryOnly", "=", "True"}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"Get", "[", 
   RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "$HRF5MRKSupportDirectory", 
      ",", "\"\<HRF_FivePointMRKExploratory.wl\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"FivePointMRKSummary", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Get", "[", 
    RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "$HRF5MRKSupportDirectory", ",", "\"\<certified_summary.wl\>\""}], 
      "}"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[4]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6fe156f0-d34f-48d3-9e86-443b6d9f6f3d"],

Cell["\<\
Run one targeted certificate with the command below in a terminal from this \
directory. The last arguments are order index, chart, a, b, topology.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"af4f8463-d943-467a-976b-0f38dfe07757"],

Cell["\<\
wolframscript -file HRF_FivePointMRKTargetedRun.wl 2 exact-soft-plus 1 2 seed\
\
\>", "Program",ExpressionUUID->"41cf974f-8b62-4aa3-a7de-7be06d2fe931"],

Cell["Rebuild the compact summary and this notebook with:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"690d366e-9cc9-491b-96a7-4fff2800df52"],

Cell["wolframscript -file HRF_RunFivePointMRKPolePinchCheck.wl", "Program",ExpressionUUID->"e61ad694-f7a5-4407-985c-1f413d6c7d50"],

Cell["\<\
wolframscript -file HRF_FivePointMRKBuildSummary.wl
wolframscript -file HRF_RunFivePointMRKPinchMomentumCheck.wl
wolframscript -file HRF_RunSpacelikeAndMRKPowerCountingChecks.wl
wolframscript -file rebuild_five_point_mrk_notebook.wl\
\>", "Program",ExpressionUUID->"2496317b-6ed1-42b6-8198-4bc993322e6c"]
},
